# Run artefacts. A run's verdicts are archived deliberately in
# QuantEcon/project-translation `research/<date>-...` — review mode overwrites its
# comment in place, so the bodies survive nowhere else — and they are far too
# large to carry here as well.
runs/

# Derived from fixtures/base + fixtures.json by `build-sites.py` and `run.mjs plan`.
# Regenerate rather than commit: a stale copy that no longer matches the base
# state is exactly the silent-drift class this whole tool exists to measure.
fixtures/sites/
fixtures/variants/
